  "releaseNotes": "HTTP DSL: ExpectStatusCode(201) checks the status of a step before the last one of a scenario, right after it runs, such as the POST that creates what the next step reads back. When the status is another, the scenario stops there, and the failure names the request and shows the body. Additive: no code changes are needed from 6.9.0. Upgrade guide: https://github.com/andrewBezerra/xunit-assured-net/blob/main/UPGRADING.md",
